{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2018-811", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2018/811", "wordCount": 1709, "segments": [{"start": 19.0, "text": "Thanks, Mike."}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "Hello everyone."}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "Design is hard but design"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "presentations are way harder."}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "I still find them daunting."}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "And today, a presentation about"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "how to present design work at"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "WWDC."}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "The struggle is real."}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "In any presentation, we have to"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "take this big and complex topic"}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "and explain it precisely."}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "Take it right down to its"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "nucleus."}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "And if we don't do that well,"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "those ideas might die."}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "All that hard work you did"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "resigned to the depths of your"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "hard drive."}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "Presentation matters."}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "As a designer at Apple, I have"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "to present design work all the"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "time."}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "Unfortunately, this year I can't"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "show you too much of that, but"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "I'm going to try and transmit to"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "you the ten most important"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "things I've learned about"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "presenting design work in the"}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "next nine minutes or so."}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "It's going to be punchy."}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "Now when you really think about"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "it, there are three fundamental"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "parts to a presentation."}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "There is me, the presenter, the"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "emotional designer consumed by"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "this problem and the prettiness"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "of it."}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "And there is you, the audience,"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "detectives of design crime,"}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "guardians of good sense,"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "Draculas of deadlines, and"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "captains of code."}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "And between us, there is this"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "central idea."}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "The thing we need to agree is"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "good for our company, good for"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "our customers, something that"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "makes the world a slightly"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "better place."}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "Let's call it a toaster."}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "And really a presentation is"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "just a mechanism to exchange"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "information about that idea, to"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "facilitate decisions and action"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "one way or another, to make this"}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "thing fly or crash right back"}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "down to Earth."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "So dear presenter, these are the"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "key things you need to"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "understand."}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "What are your objectives for"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "this presentation?"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "Clarify your objectives."}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "Are you trying to get this work"}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "approved by your superiors or"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "successfully communicate with"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "engineers?"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "Maybe you're pitching a new"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "idea."}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "Try to imagine what succeeding"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "looks like and work backwards"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "from there."}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "Identify the questions you need"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "your audience to help you"}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "answer."}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "State these and your goals up"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "front."}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "And understand the objectives of"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "your audience."}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "What do they care about?"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "Remember, your objectives"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "include addressing theirs."}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "Try not to dive in to details"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "and minutia before you clarify"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "the bigger picture."}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "Next is a big one: feedback."}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "As designers, we feel vulnerable"}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "and exposed, painting our finest"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "pictures and teeing them up to"}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "be torn to shreds."}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "Try to entertain the mindset"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "that there is no failure, only"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "feedback."}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "Take all of it seriously even"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "when you disagree. If you are presenting, you are"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "asking for feedback."}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "It's the whole point and clarify"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "the problems the audience"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "identify."}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "Sometimes people offer solutions"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "that are unworkable, but the"}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "problem they are addressing is"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "totally valid."}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "So when you have exhausted all"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "possibilities, remember this,"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "you really haven't."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "People in your audience will"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "know things you don't."}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "So be willing to change your"}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "position, especially when new"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "information has been presented."}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "Don't pretend to understand"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "unclear feedback."}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "Clarify the problem this person"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "is trying to address."}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "Don't respond like that."}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "And don't be dismissive or get"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "overly defensive."}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "It really won't help your case."}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "Seek advice."}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "Use the wisdom of your"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "colleagues."}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "Don't be afraid to ask for help."}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "They know how this works."}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "Their input is priceless."}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "Practice with them."}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "Sense check your deck."}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "Do a full practice run if it"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "merits it."}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "Do not deliver it blind."}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "The feedback will make a huge"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "difference."}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "And honestly, don't try to do"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "everything yourself."}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "Teamwork makes the dream work"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "plus it's really hard to keep"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "track of too many disparate"}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "things as one person, let alone"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "try and explain them to others"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "in a single presentation."}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "Use your own voice."}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "Be genuine."}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "Have fun."}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "Make terrible jokes."}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "Quote Bruce Lee."}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "You wouldn't be giving this"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "presentation at all if you"}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "didn't have the credibility."}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "You've earned it."}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "Express your opinion."}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "You are the expert here."}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "The audience wants to know what"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "you think and that doesn't mean"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "you have to have all the"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "answers."}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "Show your passion."}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "Why do you care about this?"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "And explain your process."}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "Show the journey you've been on."}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "How and why did you reach these"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "conclusions?"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "Don't be overconfident or"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "insincere."}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "Sometimes designers can adopt a"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "posture of being super"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "confident, bordering on arrogant"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "and avoid that."}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "It's just not cool."}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "And don't say what you think"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "people want to hear."}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "Your vote counts for a lot."}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "The audience."}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "It's not a presentation without"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "an audience."}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "Make sure you show them that"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "respect."}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "You need their cooperation to"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "give life to your ideas."}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "And if you've presented to this"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "audience before, you'll get --"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "start to get an idea of what"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "they respond to."}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "Tailor to them as much as you"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "can and always have an agenda."}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "Here's what we're going to talk"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "about in this order."}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "This is also your chance to"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "assert the point at which you'd"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "like to field feedback."}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "It almost certainly won't work"}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "that way but still do try."}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "And if you've met previously,"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "recap what happened."}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "Like when you're engrossed in a"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "series but then life happens and"}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "when you pick it up again, you"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "really grateful for that 30"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "second refresher."}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "Hey, Zach."}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "Here's a study of the character"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "that you asked for."}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "Good feedback."}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "I'm not sure about those emoji"}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "either."}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "Integrate their feedback."}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "Let them know how it affected"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "your designs."}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "Show that you're listening and"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "responding."}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "Terrible."}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "Make no assumptions, you know --"}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "people know what things mean or"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "why decisions were made."}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "You are much further along this"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "path than your audience."}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "Anticipate their questions."}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "Pay attention to their"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "reactions. And be willing to explain."}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "Do not show up without a plan or"}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "try to wing it."}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "It's not a good look."}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "And also showing your working"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "files, not good."}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "These things are lazy and"}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "disrespectful of people's time."}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "And, of course, don't be"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "dismissive of -- again, don't be"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "dismissive of anyone's input."}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "Try to be patient and objective."}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "Make it relatable to your"}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "audience. If not, they may well start to"}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "tune out."}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "Let people see themselves in"}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "your story."}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "If you can elicit an emotional"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "response, excitement, worry, or"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "even fear, it will enhance their"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "sense of commitment."}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "Ellis goes crazy for that"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "elderberry jam."}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "Use what you know about your"}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "audience to your advantage."}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "Describe what you see and feel."}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "Don't talk about users like they"}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "are a distant third party."}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "Flow diagrams can be really"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "useful with engineers but when"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "communicating concepts, there's"}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "a big disconnect."}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "Instead, speak in the first"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "person."}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "Here I am at my desk working on"}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "my e-mail and ding, a handy"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "reminder it's time for"}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "breakfast."}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "I hit the notification and bam,"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "straightaway I can load my toast"}, {"start": 605.0, "text": "without even stepping away from"}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "my desk."}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "Just one swipe down and we're"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "toasting."}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "And a few minutes later I know"}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "to be on my way, perfect timing."}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "And how cool is that?"}, {"start": 618.0, "text": "I can even see my stats."}, {"start": 621.0, "text": "Clearly, this is more powerful"}, {"start": 624.0, "text": "if you can demo a prototype."}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "And engage in dialogue."}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "A presentation should be a"}, {"start": 631.0, "text": "dialogue."}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "Engage with your audience."}, {"start": 634.0, "text": "Design for the aha moment."}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "If you can lead people through"}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "your story, their minds will try"}, {"start": 641.0, "text": "and predict the ending."}, {"start": 643.0, "text": "This will keep them engaged."}, {"start": 645.0, "text": "Ask them questions."}, {"start": 646.0, "text": "Keep them dialed in."}, {"start": 648.0, "text": "You're here for their feedback"}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "after all."}, {"start": 651.0, "text": "Do not deliver a monologue."}, {"start": 656.0, "text": "This is boring and naive."}, {"start": 659.0, "text": "Think of it as a discussion more"}, {"start": 661.0, "text": "than a speech."}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "And finally, the idea."}, {"start": 666.0, "text": "It is crucial to explain why."}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "Define each problem in a single"}, {"start": 672.0, "text": "sentence."}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "It's a great exercise to really"}, {"start": 675.0, "text": "get to the heart of the matter."}, {"start": 678.0, "text": "You'll need to find agreement on"}, {"start": 680.0, "text": "those problem statements with"}, {"start": 681.0, "text": "your audience."}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "Otherwise, you'll be barking up"}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "the wrong tree."}, {"start": 686.0, "text": "Continue to revisit, refine, and"}, {"start": 689.0, "text": "refer back to those statements"}, {"start": 690.0, "text": "as you progress and, of course,"}, {"start": 694.0, "text": "where you can, show evidence"}, {"start": 696.0, "text": "that these problems exist."}, {"start": 699.0, "text": "Boom."}, {"start": 700.0, "text": "Cold, burnt toast."}, {"start": 702.0, "text": "Tragic problems in this world."}, {"start": 706.0, "text": "Avoid using subjective reasoning"}, {"start": 709.0, "text": "for your decisions."}, {"start": 711.0, "text": "I chose this color because I"}, {"start": 713.0, "text": "like it is not remotely"}, {"start": 715.0, "text": "persuasive, especially if your"}, {"start": 717.0, "text": "audience don't share your"}, {"start": 718.0, "text": "preferences."}, {"start": 720.0, "text": "And the truth is that people"}, {"start": 723.0, "text": "really won't remember your"}, {"start": 724.0, "text": "slides."}, {"start": 726.0, "text": "They'll remember how your story"}, {"start": 727.0, "text": "made them feel if it resonated"}, {"start": 729.0, "text": "with them so sketch out the"}, {"start": 733.0, "text": "narrative of your presentation"}, {"start": 735.0, "text": "early."}, {"start": 736.0, "text": "The most successful designers I"}, {"start": 738.0, "text": "know do this."}, {"start": 740.0, "text": "It's another thing that will"}, {"start": 741.0, "text": "help you focus and use your time"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "effectively."}, {"start": 745.0, "text": "So where you can, incorporate a"}, {"start": 747.0, "text": "story with a distinct beginning,"}, {"start": 749.0, "text": "middle, and an end."}, {"start": 752.0, "text": "People intuitively get stories."}, {"start": 756.0, "text": "And it'll really help them"}, {"start": 757.0, "text": "follow along."}, {"start": 759.0, "text": "Contrast today's reality with a"}, {"start": 762.0, "text": "better future."}, {"start": 763.0, "text": "Nancy Duarte, a master of"}, {"start": 767.0, "text": "presentations, discovered in her"}, {"start": 769.0, "text": "research that some of the"}, {"start": 771.0, "text": "greatest and most effective"}, {"start": 772.0, "text": "presentations follow this"}, {"start": 774.0, "text": "structure. And the key thing here is"}, {"start": 777.0, "text": "providing the contrast between"}, {"start": 779.0, "text": "what is today's reality and what"}, {"start": 782.0, "text": "could be, what the future could"}, {"start": 785.0, "text": "look like if we make the ideas"}, {"start": 787.0, "text": "we're presenting our new"}, {"start": 788.0, "text": "reality."}, {"start": 790.0, "text": "Today, people are frustrated,"}, {"start": 793.0, "text": "cold, joyless toast."}, {"start": 796.0, "text": "It's an epidemic."}, {"start": 798.0, "text": "But imagine happy, flawless"}, {"start": 800.0, "text": "toast at the top of the button"}, {"start": 802.0, "text": "on your iPhone."}, {"start": 805.0, "text": "But don't get too carried away."}, {"start": 808.0, "text": "That is a rookie mistake."}, {"start": 812.0, "text": "Keep it simple."}, {"start": 815.0, "text": "The main thing is to keep the"}, {"start": 817.0, "text": "main thing the main thing."}, {"start": 823.0, "text": "I love this quote."}, {"start": 824.0, "text": "And I always find myself coming"}, {"start": 826.0, "text": "back to it."}, {"start": 827.0, "text": "It's such a perfect expression."}, {"start": 829.0, "text": "If I had more time, I would have"}, {"start": 831.0, "text": "written a shorter letter."}, {"start": 833.0, "text": "Relevant not only for"}, {"start": 835.0, "text": "presentations and writing"}, {"start": 838.0, "text": "e-mails but as a philosophy"}, {"start": 840.0, "text": "toward design."}, {"start": 842.0, "text": "Don't overload people with too"}, {"start": 844.0, "text": "much information."}, {"start": 846.0, "text": "Strip away everything that isn't"}, {"start": 848.0, "text": "essential to your mission or"}, {"start": 849.0, "text": "your message."}, {"start": 851.0, "text": "And finally, don't forget to"}, {"start": 854.0, "text": "summarize."}, {"start": 856.0, "text": "Know your objectives, otherwise"}, {"start": 859.0, "text": "what's the point?"}, {"start": 861.0, "text": "Embrace feedback."}, {"start": 862.0, "text": "It's what you're here for."}, {"start": 865.0, "text": "Seek advice."}, {"start": 866.0, "text": "Your colleagues are smart."}, {"start": 868.0, "text": "And use your own voice."}, {"start": 870.0, "text": "It's the best one you have."}, {"start": 873.0, "text": "Respect your audience or they"}, {"start": 875.0, "text": "won't respect you."}, {"start": 877.0, "text": "Make it relatable, otherwise"}, {"start": 879.0, "text": "they'll forget it."}, {"start": 881.0, "text": "Engage in dialogue to keep them"}, {"start": 885.0, "text": "present and explain why."}, {"start": 888.0, "text": "It's the million dollar question."}, {"start": 890.0, "text": "Utilize storytelling because it"}, {"start": 892.0, "text": "works."}, {"start": 893.0, "text": "And keep it simple even though"}, {"start": 896.0, "text": "it's not. Good luck with your"}]}
